.sp 1
.RS 5
.PD 0
.TP 3
\*(BU
Full or incremental backup with quick and easy restoration
of files.
.TP 3
\*(BU
Multiple physical volumes per archive.
.TP 3
\*(BU
Data integrity assurance via checksum computation on every
